      "worked": "Class centres: $3,\\ 8,\\ 13,\\ 18$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum f&=3+6+8+9=26\\\\\\sum(cc\\times f)&=3\\times3+8\\times6+13\\times8+18\\times9\\\\\\sum(cc\\times f)&=9+48+104+162=323\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{323}{26}\\\\\\bar{x}&\\approx12.42\\end{align*}$$",
